<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Portal PIB São Miguel</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Montserrat:wght@400;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
            background-color: #0d1b2e;
            color: #f5f0e8;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 50px 20px;
            margin: 0;
        }

        h1 {
            color: #c9a84c;
            font-weight: 800;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
        }

        .cards {
            display: flex;
            gap: 20px;
            justify-content: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            margin-top: 40px;
        }

        .card {
            background: #f5f0e8;
            color: #0d1b2e;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            text-decoration: none;
            width: 250px;
            font-weight: 700;
            transition: transform 0.3s;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
        }

        .card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            background: #c9a84c;
        }

        .card span {
            font-size: 40px;
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .card h2 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 18px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <h1>Portal PIB São Miguel</h1>
    <p>Bem-vindo ao nosso ecossistema digital.</p>

    <div class="cards">
        <a href="https://boletim.pibsaomiguel.com.br" class="card">
            <span>📖</span>
            <h2>Boletim Semanal</h2>
        </a>
        <a href="https://calendario.pibsaomiguel.com.br" class="card">
            <span>📅</span>
            <h2>Calendário</h2>
        </a>
    </div>
</body>

</html>